    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.poster.avif?t=1751299551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.webm?t=1751299551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.mp4?t=1751299551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/99bebbb4721d5b3e1d2beb4a32b05a81.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A desolate hospital hallway - the red door waits at the end</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/5570df83c6945a760b73a18b0cd2fb37.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Her love became a curse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/6ae2973fdfe217c4de9aa64e3f4e9e1b.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years of coma, two more skulls to end it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/0be45e627198123f89001c8571c7e001.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your daughter\u2019s barrier pulses with unnatural energy</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Beyond the Red Door&quot;</strong> is a gripping <strong>first-person horror experience</strong> that plunges you into a nightmare where reality and the unknown collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven years ago, a devastating <strong>car accident</strong> shattered your life\u2014your wife was lost, and your daughter has remained in a coma ever since. Haunted by guilt and grief, you find yourself trapped in a <strong>terrifying dream</strong>, standing before a <strong>massive crimson door</strong>. A voice whispers from beyond\u2014your daughter's soul is trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, you awaken from a <strong>disturbing dream</strong> of a massive <strong>red door</strong>, only to find yourself somewhere else\u2014<strong>a dark, twisted world</strong> beyond comprehension. You didn\u2019t mean to enter, but now you\u2019re trapped. A voice echoes in the void\u2014your daughter\u2019s soul is here, lost and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her, you must <strong>navigate the horrors of this nightmarish realm</strong>, unlocking its secrets while avoiding the shadows that lurk within. Armed with only a flashlight and your wits, you must <strong>survive and escape the nightmare</strong> before it consumes you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.poster.avif?t=1751299551\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.webm?t=1751299551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/d1c7549793f5cf979cc7b8ee27f883c9.mp4?t=1751299551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/99bebbb4721d5b3e1d2beb4a32b05a81.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A desolate hospital hallway - the red door waits at the end</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/5570df83c6945a760b73a18b0cd2fb37.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Her love became a curse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/6ae2973fdfe217c4de9aa64e3f4e9e1b.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years of coma, two more skulls to end it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540100/extras/0be45e627198123f89001c8571c7e001.avif?t=1751299551\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your daughter\u2019s barrier pulses with unnatural energy</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Beyond the Red Door&quot;</strong> is a gripping <strong>first-person horror experience</strong> that plunges you into a nightmare where reality and the unknown collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven years ago, a devastating <strong>car accident</strong> shattered your life\u2014your wife was lost, and your daughter has remained in a coma ever since. Haunted by guilt and grief, you find yourself trapped in a <strong>terrifying dream</strong>, standing before a <strong>massive crimson door</strong>. A voice whispers from beyond\u2014your daughter's soul is trapped inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, you awaken from a <strong>disturbing dream</strong> of a massive <strong>red door</strong>, only to find yourself somewhere else\u2014<strong>a dark, twisted world</strong> beyond comprehension. You didn\u2019t mean to enter, but now you\u2019re trapped. A voice echoes in the void\u2014your daughter\u2019s soul is here, lost and waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save her, you must <strong>navigate the horrors of this nightmarish realm</strong>, unlocking its secrets while avoiding the shadows that lurk within. Armed with only a flashlight and your wits, you must <strong>survive and escape the nightmare</strong> before it consumes you.</p>",
    "short_description": "A first-person walking simulator horror (60 mins). As a desperate father, explore a nightmare hospital to retrieve the red skull\u2014the only key to breaking the barrier trapping your daughter's soul. But the building remembers you... and your dead wife walks here.",
