        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card with 3D audio<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended to reduce loading times. Headphones with surround sound recommended for immersive horror experience. Ray tracing enabled for high-end GPUs (optional setting).</li></ul>"
